{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first game developed by myself, Dark Grid is a 2D game with survival and exploration as its main gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique worldview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you wake up, the world is already like this: eternal night, endless darkness. You don't know what happened, but you don't have time to think too much. Hunger and various pressures come rushing towards you, and you need to survive first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, there are two strange sounds constantly surrounding you, a self proclaimed &quot;friend&quot; who will occasionally come to &quot;visit&quot; you; The other claims to be the 'Dark Lord' and provides you with dark abilities, seemingly with intentions towards you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prevent monster invasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/8996d046d9f9f79a744849cd2d24a943.poster.avif?t=1760012172\" width=1020 height=622 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/8996d046d9f9f79a744849cd2d24a943.webm?t=1760012172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/8996d046d9f9f79a744849cd2d24a943.mp4?t=1760012172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive and explore the surroundings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main gameplay of the game is Survival + Exploration. You will explore a world composed of grids, collect discovered food and resources, fill your stomach, maintain the illumination of the luminous tower, and don't let it go out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The darkness in the game follows like a shadow, it exists everywhere: the places you haven't explored, the places you have already walked. Only light can dispel darkness, only the Luminous Tower is an eternal home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/c1efc97a0485a46ddf853665e06d92ce.poster.avif?t=1760012172\" width=794 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/c1efc97a0485a46ddf853665e06d92ce.webm?t=1760012172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/c1efc97a0485a46ddf853665e06d92ce.mp4?t=1760012172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Construct</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games can utilize resources to build various types of buildings, which can help you survive better in this cruel world. As the game progresses, you will acquire a variety of buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/069d229092a6e9d6868af46a6c68a459.poster.avif?t=1760012172\" width=956 height=572 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/069d229092a6e9d6868af46a6c68a459.webm?t=1760012172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/069d229092a6e9d6868af46a6c68a459.mp4?t=1760012172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique artistic style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist world composed of squares and various icon symbols:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/63d3ae1d1a1525085b94042aaccbe410.poster.avif?t=1760012172\" width=1064 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/63d3ae1d1a1525085b94042aaccbe410.webm?t=1760012172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/63d3ae1d1a1525085b94042aaccbe410.mp4?t=1760012172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other things I want to say</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the developer's first game released on Steam, currently in full-speed development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to making a real game for the first time, it is definitely not perfect, <span class=\"bb_strike\">and after playing it, you may curse: What kind of garbage game!</span> But it carries my hard work, and I will constantly improve it. If you have any improvement suggestions or encounter bugs, please feel free to contact me. This will help me continuously hone my game design and development skills, and bring more fun games to everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact Me</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal QQ: 1513070485</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3851710?t=1760012172","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/c31600f0f26926ea19b4f285e8cbdbbf5df0af39/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760012172","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/34efad5f8451e068fe0d5a2e7d498eac5b12d3fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760012172","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/34efad5f8451e068fe0d5a2e7d498eac5b12d3fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760012172","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3880460,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first game developed by myself, Dark Grid is a 2D game with survival and exploration as its main gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique worldview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you wake up, the world is already like this: eternal night, endless darkness. You don't know what happened, but you don't have time to think too much. Hunger and various pressures come rushing towards you, and you need to survive first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, there are two strange sounds constantly surrounding you, a self proclaimed &quot;friend&quot; who will occasionally come to &quot;visit&quot; you; The other claims to be the 'Dark Lord' and provides you with dark abilities, seemingly with intentions towards you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prevent monster invasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/8996d046d9f9f79a744849cd2d24a943.poster.avif?t=1760012172\" width=1020 height=622 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/8996d046d9f9f79a744849cd2d24a943.webm?t=1760012172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/8996d046d9f9f79a744849cd2d24a943.mp4?t=1760012172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive and explore the surroundings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main gameplay of the game is Survival + Exploration. You will explore a world composed of grids, collect discovered food and resources, fill your stomach, maintain the illumination of the luminous tower, and don't let it go out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The darkness in the game follows like a shadow, it exists everywhere: the places you haven't explored, the places you have already walked. Only light can dispel darkness, only the Luminous Tower is an eternal home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/c1efc97a0485a46ddf853665e06d92ce.poster.avif?t=1760012172\" width=794 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/c1efc97a0485a46ddf853665e06d92ce.webm?t=1760012172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/c1efc97a0485a46ddf853665e06d92ce.mp4?t=1760012172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Construct</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games can utilize resources to build various types of buildings, which can help you survive better in this cruel world. As the game progresses, you will acquire a variety of buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/069d229092a6e9d6868af46a6c68a459.poster.avif?t=1760012172\" width=956 height=572 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/069d229092a6e9d6868af46a6c68a459.webm?t=1760012172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/069d229092a6e9d6868af46a6c68a459.mp4?t=1760012172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique artistic style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist world composed of squares and various icon symbols:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/63d3ae1d1a1525085b94042aaccbe410.poster.avif?t=1760012172\" width=1064 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/63d3ae1d1a1525085b94042aaccbe410.webm?t=1760012172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/63d3ae1d1a1525085b94042aaccbe410.mp4?t=1760012172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other things I want to say</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the developer's first game released on Steam, currently in full-speed development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to making a real game for the first time, it is definitely not perfect, <span class=\"bb_strike\">and after playing it, you may curse: What kind of garbage game!</span> But it carries my hard work, and I will constantly improve it. If you have any improvement suggestions or encounter bugs, please feel free to contact me. This will help me continuously hone my game design and development skills, and bring more fun games to everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact Me</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal QQ: 1513070485</p>","developers":["Moonlight Sand"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/0238648cf5928447158d99aab984ab6b0aa2d7b0/header.jpg?t=1760012172","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_